· Each row is a single rounded pill — tight inner dividers
   replace separator lines
· Visual grouping via background, not whitespace
· Settings = last (rightmost in last pill)
· Pros:  scannable groups, premium feel, less padding
         per icon
· Cons:  more CSS work (segmented buttons), shared border
         radii tricky, internal dividers add noise
